  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Agreement TVET</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the ILO&apos;s Global programme for skills and lifelong learning, this agreement covers activities on a global level, a regional level and in six countries: Ethiopia, Ghana, Lebanon, Malawi, Senegal and Tanzania.The global component focuses on innovative solutions and digitisation. The regional component focuses on Africa for skills systems to become more inclusive through skills partnerships on migration and skills-based approaches to combat modern slavery. The country initiatives addresses skills mismatches and decent job creation in various sectors. Overall there is a focus on the inclusion of women and persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
